      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100400303/1004003030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "他事務所の面接官",
    "text": "全国区を目指すアイドルとしてはちょっとね\r\nまぁ、最初は個性的ってもてはやされるかもしれないけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003030030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……えっと",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400303/1004003030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "他事務所の面接官",
    "text": "それで、なんでうちの事務所を\r\n受けてくれたんだっけ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003030040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "それは……うち、あ、私\r\n絶対にアイドルになりたか……なりたくて！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400303/1004003030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003030050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "それで、オーディションは全部\r\n片っ端から受けと……受けてるんです！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400303/1004003030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "他事務所の面接官",
    "text": "……ふーん、そっか\r\nじゃあ別にうちの事務所じゃなくてもいいってことだね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003030060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "え……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400303/1004003030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "他事務所の面接官",
    "text": "アイドルになれればどこでもいいってことだよね？\r\n今自分でそう言ってたと思うんだけど、違った？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003030070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "え……えーっと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400303/1004003030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "他事務所の面接官",
    "text": "それから、先に送ってもらってた\r\nダンスと歌の動画も拝見しました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "他事務所の面接官",
    "text": "月岡さん、歌もダンスもきちんと習ったこと無いでしょう？\r\n基礎ができてなかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003030080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "えっ\r\nでも、うち……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400303/1004003030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "他事務所の面接官",
    "text": "ダンスも失敗して転びかけてたし、\r\nそのせいで歌もいまいちだったかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "他事務所の面接官",
    "text": "普通だったら最初から撮り直すと思うけど……\r\nまさか、一番上手くできたのがあれなの？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003030090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400303/1004003030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "他事務所の面接官",
    "text": "そう\r\nやる気が無いのか、それとも才能がないのか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003030100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "う、うち！　やる気だけは、\r\n誰にも負け……負けません……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400303/1004003030100"
  },
